==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage can easily be rushed using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]. Simply bring as many Starting Money Up [[Cat Combo|Cat Combos]] as possible and deploy Awakened Bahamut as soon as possible. If done correctly, Bahamut should tear through the initial Li'l Zyclones and destroy the base before LeMurr can spawn.

